### MindChat - Appointment Service API Tests
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5002
@gatewayUrl = http://localhost:8080
@token = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Health Check via Gateway
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/appointments/health

###
### APPOINTMENTS ENDPOINTS
###

### Get All Appointments
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get All Appointments via Gateway
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Appointment by ID
@appointmentId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/appointments/{{appointmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Appointments by Psychologist
@psychologistId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/appointments/psychologist/{{psychologistId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Appointments by Patient
@patientId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/appointments/patient/{{patientId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create New Appointment
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "psychologistId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "patientId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "scheduledAt": "2024-02-15T10:00:00Z",
  "notes": "Primera sesión de terapia cognitiva"
}

### Create Appointment via Gateway
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "psychologistId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "patientId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "scheduledAt": "2024-02-20T14:30:00Z",
  "notes": "Seguimiento de sesión anterior"
}

### Update Appointment
@updateAppointmentId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/appointments/{{updateAppointmentId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "scheduledAt": "2024-02-15T15:00:00Z",
  "notes": "Cambio de horario - Primera sesión de terapia cognitiva"
}

### Cancel Appointment
@cancelAppointmentId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/appointments/{{cancelAppointmentId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cancel Appointment via Gateway
PATCH {{gatewayUrl}}/api/appointments/{{cancelAppointmentId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Delete Appointment
@deleteAppointmentId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/appointments/{{deleteAppointmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
### ERROR CASES
###

### Create Appointment with Past Date (should fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "psychologistId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "patientId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "scheduledAt": "2020-01-01T10:00:00Z",
  "notes": "Esta fecha ya pasó"
}

### Get Non-existent Appointment
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/appointments/99999999-9999-9999-9999-999999999999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

